        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "之橫字如岳，之高第十三弟也。",
        "reading": "之橫字如岳，梁傳、殿本均作之高第十三弟；南史作第十二弟，字作如嶽。",
        "note": "之橫字如岳，梁傳、殿本均作之高第十三弟；南史作第十二弟，字作如嶽。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 14,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence1-14",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "少好賓遊，重氣俠，不事產業。",
        "reading": "少好交遊，不治產業。",
        "note": "少好交遊，不治產業。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 14,
        "end_codepoint": 28,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence1-28",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "之高以其縱誕，乃爲狹被蔬食以激厲之。",
        "reading": "兄之高以狹被、蔬食勸勵。",
        "note": "兄之高以狹被、蔬食勸勵。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 28,
        "end_codepoint": 46,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence1-46",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "之橫歎曰：「大丈夫富貴，必作百幅被。」",
        "reading": "之橫立富貴後作百幅被之志。",
        "note": "之橫立富貴後作百幅被之志。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 46,
        "end_codepoint": 65,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence1-65",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "遂與僮屬數百人，於芍陂大營田墅，遂致殷積。",
        "reading": "與僮屬在芍陂經營田墅，資產漸多。",
        "note": "與僮屬在芍陂經營田墅，資產漸多。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 65,
        "end_codepoint": 86,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence1-86",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "太宗在東宮，聞而要之，以爲河東王常侍、直殿主帥，遷直閤將軍。",
        "reading": "太宗蕭綱為太子時延納，任河東王常侍、直殿主帥，遷直閤將軍。",
        "note": "太宗蕭綱為太子時延納，任河東王常侍、直殿主帥，遷直閤將軍。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 86,
        "end_codepoint": 116,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence1-116",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "侯景亂，出爲貞威將軍，隸鄱陽王範討景。",
        "reading": "侯景亂，出任貞威將軍，從鄱陽王範。",
        "note": "侯景亂，出任貞威將軍，從鄱陽王範。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 116,
        "end_codepoint": 135,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence1-135",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "景濟江，仍與範長子嗣入援。",
        "reading": "隨範長子蕭嗣入援。「嗣」在此是人名。",
        "note": "隨範長子蕭嗣入援。「嗣」在此是人名。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 135,
        "end_codepoint": 148,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence1-148",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "連營度淮，據東城。",
        "reading": "渡淮，據東城。",
        "note": "渡淮，據東城。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 148,
        "end_codepoint": 157,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence1-157",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "京都陷，退還合肥，與範溯流赴湓城。",
        "reading": "京都陷，退合肥，與範往湓城。",
        "note": "京都陷，退合肥，與範往湓城。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 157,
        "end_codepoint": 174,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence1-174",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "景遣任約上逼晉熙，範令之橫下援，未及至，範薨，之橫乃還。",
        "reading": "侯景遣任約，蕭範令之橫赴援。之橫未至而範薨。",
        "note": "侯景遣任約，蕭範令之橫赴援。之橫未至而範薨。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 174,
        "end_codepoint": 202,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence2-0",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "時尋陽王大心在江州，範副梅思立密要大心襲湓城，之橫斬思立而拒大心。",
        "reading": "範之副梅思立邀尋陽王蕭大心襲湓城，為之橫所殺。",
        "note": "範之副梅思立邀尋陽王蕭大心襲湓城，為之橫所殺。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 33,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence2-33",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "大心以州降景。",
        "reading": "大心以江州降侯景。",
        "note": "大心以江州降侯景。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 33,
        "end_codepoint": 40,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence2-40",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "之橫率衆與兄之高同歸元帝，承制除散騎常侍、廷尉卿，出爲河東內史。",
        "reading": "之橫與兄之高同歸元帝，在承制時除散騎常侍、廷尉卿，出為河東內史。",
        "note": "之橫與兄之高同歸元帝，在承制時除散騎常侍、廷尉卿，出為河東內史。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 40,
        "end_codepoint": 72,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence2-72",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "又隨王僧辯拒侯景於巴陵，景退，遷持節、平北將軍、東徐州刺史，中護軍，封豫寧侯，邑三千戶。",
        "reading": "從王僧辯拒侯景，遷平北將軍、東徐州刺史、中護軍，封豫寧侯，邑三千戶。",
        "note": "從王僧辯拒侯景，遷平北將軍、東徐州刺史、中護軍，封豫寧侯，邑三千戶。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 72,
        "end_codepoint": 116,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence2-116",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "又隨僧辯追景，平郢、魯、江、晉等州，恒爲前鋒陷陣。",
        "reading": "從僧辯進軍，平郢、魯、江、晉諸州。",
        "note": "從僧辯進軍，平郢、魯、江、晉諸州。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 116,
        "end_codepoint": 141,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence2-141",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "仍至石頭，破景，景東奔，僧辯令之橫與杜崱入守臺城。",
        "reading": "與杜崱同入守臺城。",
        "note": "與杜崱同入守臺城。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 141,
        "end_codepoint": 166,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence2-166",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "及陸納據湘州叛，又隸王僧辯南討焉。",
        "reading": "陸納據湘州，之橫隨王僧辯南討。",
        "note": "陸納據湘州，之橫隨王僧辯南討。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 166,
        "end_codepoint": 183,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence2-183",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "于陣斬納將李賢明，遂平之。",
        "reading": "李賢明是陸納部將。",
        "note": "李賢明是陸納部將。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 183,
        "end_codepoint": 196,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence2-196",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "又破武陵王於硤口。",
        "reading": "武陵王為蕭紀。",
        "note": "武陵王為蕭紀。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 196,
        "end_codepoint": 205,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence2-205",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "還除吳興太守，乃作百幅被，以成其初志。",
        "reading": "還任吳興太守，作百幅被，回應開篇所言。",
        "note": "還任吳興太守，作百幅被，回應開篇所言。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 205,
        "end_codepoint": 224,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence3-0",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "後江陵陷，齊遣上黨王高渙挾貞陽侯攻東關，晉安王方智承制，以之橫爲使持節、鎮北將軍、徐州刺史，都督衆軍，給鼓吹一部，出守蘄城。",
        "reading": "江陵陷後，齊上黨王高渙送貞陽侯蕭淵明。固定本作晉安王方智承制，殿本作綱；梁敬帝紀具方智受封、江陵陷後承製的次第。",
        "note": "江陵陷後，齊上黨王高渙送貞陽侯蕭淵明。固定本作晉安王方智承制，殿本作綱；梁敬帝紀具方智受封、江陵陷後承製的次第。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 62,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence3-62",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "之橫營壘未周，而齊軍大至，兵盡矢窮，遂於陣沒，時年四十一。",
        "reading": "齊軍至蘄城，之橫陣沒，年四十一。殿本作魏軍。通鑑記齊克東關，北齊書記高渙斬裴之橫。",
        "note": "齊軍至蘄城，之橫陣沒，年四十一。殿本作魏軍。通鑑記齊克東關，北齊書記高渙斬裴之橫。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 62,
        "end_codepoint": 91,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:received_sentence3-91",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD",
        "source_quote": "贈侍中、司空公，諡曰忠壯。",
        "reading": "贈侍中、司空公，諡忠壯；殿本司空不帶公字。",
        "note": "贈侍中、司空公，諡忠壯；殿本司空不帶公字。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-peizhiheng-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 91,
        "end_codepoint": 104,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
